{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby, pick up and check properties, then do task1. Else, if path clear, move forward. Finally, scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = Task1    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <Action ID = MoveForward    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
